<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The clock read exactly 7:00 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was probably still at the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and I were back at Zahha.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's gonna happen to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> now...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"She'll be all right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is a strong person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is a little timid and delicate, the sort of person who looks like she could break at any moment.<PG>
But for the three years since we met, I had watched <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> from right beside her the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was no good at sports, and there were times in club activities and the like when the people around her laughed at her, but she never once gave up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's a weak-looking person, but she isn't a weak person.<PG>
I truly respect that about <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why I can feel that I want to be with <STYLE ID="1">this person</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When a <STYLE ID="1">senpai</STYLE> like that is in trouble, I want to be of help.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... she saw her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face, didn't she... at the police station..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It seems so... I think it was truly hard on her."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I said that, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> sank down onto the floor.
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
I called the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While it rang, I prayed again and again that I was only thinking too much.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車室内エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "30"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Someone came from the police station to pick us up right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The whole time we were in the patrol car, I held <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s hand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was looking down blankly, with no expression.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was looking down in the same way, but in contrast to <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, her face was rigid.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "350" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the police station, the moment <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> saw her </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>, the two of them held each other and wept.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing the story, it seemed her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> had had a very hard time of it too.<PG>
Needless to say, her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> had not gone to Hokkaido at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When he did not come in to work on time, his company phoned <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the time, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was at <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s place, in the middle of watching a DVD.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nobody was home, so the company called her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>'s cell phone.<PG>
That was the first anyone knew that he had not gone to Hokkaido.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no reaching her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE>, whatever they tried.<PG>
Not wanting to worry her <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE>, her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> got word to <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>: "I'm going to be late today."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> consulted the police, but inside the force they were running around in circles over the flayed body.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Someone thought, "It can't be."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> = the flayed body<PG>
But her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> did not want to tell <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> until she had proof.<PG>
To the police,<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Don't tell my </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> yet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was what she said, but to the police <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> was a person of interest.<PG>
Without telling her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>, the police went to <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s home, and since nobody was there, they withdrew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The patrol car we saw on the way back from Zahha was that one.<PG>
But when her mom was told that her <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE>, who was supposed to be at home under the stay-at-home order, was not next door either, she must have finally begun to worry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her cell phone had run out of charge, so she called from a phone at the police station.<PG>
When I had <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> show me the number that had called her, the last four digits were 0110.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was a high probability that this was a number from a police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently my bad feeling had hit the mark, at a probability of 90 percent or better.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\霊安室表札.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> came face to face with her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took a full hour for <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> to come out of the mortuary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> been thinking during that time?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "550" "B" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, accompanied by a police officer, came back to the waiting area where we were.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Hold on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> rushed straight over to <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and held her up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "280" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... thank you. I'm all right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s forced smile.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The truth is, I was scared to look at </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face... But, I'm glad I got to see his face at the end..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... Then that's good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of them sank down onto the floor, still holding each other.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> never let the smile break, but <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> began to cry out loud.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't cry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm all right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could not bear to watch, and looked down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> looks weak, but she is strong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, when she tries to put on the strong face, it's hard on us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, why does </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hate cherry blossoms?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? I dunno... By the time I noticed, she'd always hated them. Even though we did go to hanami together when we were little...</STYLE> [TN: hanami = cherry-blossom viewing]
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Is something going on?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"When I consider this incident and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s dream, I get the feeling it's connected to the April sickness. And to the incident from more than 10 years ago."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But, that was an accident, wasn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. It does seem certain that it was an accident, but we can't ignore it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"True enough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By then, I had made up my mind about one thing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm going to look into the incident from 10 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hold on a second...!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She collapsed into her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>'s arms in tears, and when I saw <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> like that, I swore it in my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to save <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> is never coming back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet, and yet...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I want to track them down."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "9" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey now... I get how you feel, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I love so much is suffering. I want to be of help, even a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> fell silent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have wanted to argue, but the next words would not come.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
